msgstr "When a conference is active, use Ctrl+Shift+ArrowUp to mute or unmute your microphone, Ctrl+Shift+ArrowLeft to start or stop your camera, Ctrl+Shift+ArrowRight to cycle layouts, Ctrl+Shift+ArrowDown to focus the next participant, and Ctrl+Shift+Q to open the leave confirmation. Hold Ctrl+Shift+Z for push-to-talk while muted. Conference shortcuts do not fire from editable text fields."

