msgstr "If the media connection is interrupted, the conference tries a short automatic recovery sequence. When automatic recovery is exhausted, use Retry to request a fresh media offer without closing the conference window."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_channel_conference.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format, fuzzy
msgid "Inside the conference, use the layout buttons to switch between automatic, grid, focus and speaker layouts, show or hide the participant panel, pin important participants, cycle your self-view between tile, picture-in-picture and hidden, or switch to compact mode when you want the call to take less of the page. Larger calls automatically use a denser grid while focus and speaker layouts keep a filmstrip for the remaining participants."
msgstr "Inside the conference window, use the layout buttons to switch between automatic, grid, focus and speaker layouts, show or hide the participant panel, pin important participants, cycle your self-view between tile, picture-in-picture and hidden, or switch to compact mode when you want the call to stay visible while you keep working in chat. Larger calls automatically use a denser grid while focus and speaker layouts keep a filmstrip for the remaining participants."

