msgstr "The conference window shows explicit states while waiting for participants, joining receive-only, recovering media, or handling a failed connection. Recoverable failures keep the call open and expose Retry; leaving from a warning or error still uses the confirmation dialog so microphone, camera and SFU cleanup stay predictable."

